  "abstract_summary": "Text-to-image (T2I) models are judged by benchmarks that measure whether requested content appears, but these benchmarks largely overlook the complementary ability to satisfy negated constraints, for example, generating \"a non-red cup.\" Measuring negation raises challenges not faced by affirmation-based benchmarks a...",
